00:25:40.560 --> 00:25:44.370
Viewer page directly in a little bit but not
there yet.

00:25:44.370 --> 00:25:58.170
I will change the assembly version just by
cheating and typing the .25 in there.

00:25:58.170 --> 00:26:07.370
You see now on that I'm on GRCh37 patch 13
